# groups2 — recovering stuck messages with XAUTOCLAIM
#
# Learn: when a consumer dies, its pending entries stay pending forever:
# XREADGROUP ... > only hands out NEW entries. XPENDING shows who holds
# what and for how long; XAUTOCLAIM key group consumer min-idle-ms start
# transfers entries idle for longer than min-idle-ms to another consumer.
#
# Task: consumer bob crashed ten minutes ago holding 1700000000000-0 and
# 1700000000000-1. Consumer carol is alive and just picked up
# 1700000000000-2. As alice, take over every entry that has been idle
# for more than a minute, then acknowledge the two you recovered. Don't
# take carol's entry, and don't read new ones.
#

XPENDING events mailer
XREADGROUP GROUP mailer alice STREAMS events >
